OL,3,GNEWSATheatre boss departs after 11
OL,4,Ayears as CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of the Curve Theatre in
OL,7,FLeicester is stepping down after more
OL,8,Fthan a decade in charge of the venue.
OL,10,FChris Stafford was appointed CEO in
OL,11,F2015, having previously served as
OL,12,Fexecutive producer alongside artistic
OL,13,Fdirector Nikolai Foster.
OL,15,FAudience attendance at the theatre
OL,16,Fincreased by 34% during his tenure,
OL,17,Falong with learning and participation
OL,18,Fengagement by 62% and annual turnover
OL,19,Fby 156%.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
